  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The contents are ReadOnlyMemory<byte> instead of Stream: no positions, no disposal, no side effects. Breaking changes: Data and MetaData are ReadOnlyMemory<byte> (empty instead of null; assign byte arrays directly, use node.Data.AsInt() instead of node.Data?.AsInt()); the Data conversions take and return ReadOnlyMemory<byte>; the save events and the load events are removed. New: ToBytes, FromBytes (also with the number of bytes consumed), ToBase64String, FromBase64String, Data.FromElement, AsElement, Data.FromBytes; the conversions are little-endian on every platform; large contents are saved without copying. The binary format is unchanged.",
